Package: pve-triton-dxvk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Triton host renderer libraries (DXVK native, headless dmabuf WSI)
 Forked DXVK built as native Linux shared libraries (libdxvk_d3d11.so,
 libdxvk_dxgi.so, ...) for the UTM/Neptune Triton D3D11 virtualization
 stack. The headless WSI exports rendered frames as dmabufs for
 scanout through virtio-gpu. Installed under /usr/lib/pve-triton/dxvk
 (private to pve-triton-virglrenderer / pve-triton-qemu).
 Upstream: https://github.com/osy/dxvk
